{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"746939355003748354","content":"Mk so, subclass is \"me and a crappy pigeon\" starter feature: smeared- you can use a bonus action to have a pigeon mark a target within 60 ft via feces for 1 minute. This mark grants a +1 to all of your damage rolls against marked creatures. The mark can stack a number of times on one creature equal to your consitution modifier. When you reach 10th level of pigeon lord you can mark two creatures in one bonus action.\n\nRibbon ability, get shit done: you get a bonus to your next ability check or saving throw equal to the level of the last spell slot a pigeon has used on your behalf.\n\nCrap dieme- as an action you mark an area with a 60 ft radius for your next strike. At the start of your next turn your next spell will be the signal for the pigeons to defecate the area, dealing 3d6 psychic damage and applying one stack of smeared to all creatures within the area. Once you use this feature you cannot use it again until the ens of a long rest","created_at":"2020-09-14T21:23:38.696000Z","edited_at":"2020-09-14T21:25:08.283000Z","id":"755176963869769768","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
